(409, 3, '2025-11-17', '06:30:32', '15:01:21', '06:30:32', '17:30:00', 'Since this is the start of my Work-From-Home setup every Monday, I needed to wait for my Team Leader, Bryan, to complete my authentication before I could access some apps including Harley. In the meantime, I asked a colleague to temporarily log me in so I wouldn’t fall behind. However, when their shift ended, they accidentally logged me out, assuming it was their own account.', 'Approved', '2025-11-17 15:14:18', 'attach_691acb3107d892.77149422.png', '2025-11-25 04:47:41', 0, 0),
